s corner (x 1600-1790 px); K01's side stoop refuses a flight whose foot passes the front's end, so it runs out to the walk (liberty L-k01-2008-calumet-3790). From this camera the two flights overlap on the picture, but the flight turns the other way [the plate's drawing, cropped and reduced: read in the plate's record; pixel places here are the plate's]
